                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.00/833: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacVeagh</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-04-24T11:00:00+02:00">April 24, 1935—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 24—6:39 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>56. My 55, April 23, 7 p.m. Generals were shot at dawn this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacVeagh</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
